# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4  REST – GuestCards  /api/GuestCards
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4.1 GET all guest cards (paged)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.2 GET with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards?pageNumber=1&pageSize=2
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.3 GET filtered by canteenUnit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards?canteenUnit=1001
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.4 GET by canteenUnit (seeded: 1001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards/1001
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.5 GET by canteenUnit (seeded: 1002)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards/1002
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.6 POST – create new guest card
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "canteenUnit": 2001,
  "cardSequence": 10,
  "cardNumber": "CARD-TEST-001",
  "cardName": "Test Guest User",
  "cardType": "G",
  "reportingUnit": "IT",
  "reportingDepartment": 50,
  "effectiveDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

###

### 4.7 PUT – update guest card
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards/2001
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "canteenUnit": 2001,
  "cardName": "Test Guest User (Updated)",
  "cardType": "V",
  "reportingUnit": "IT-B",
  "reportingDepartment": 55
}

###

### 4.8 PATCH – close guest card
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards/2001/close
Authorization: {{authHeader}}

###

### 4.9 GET – 404 for non-existent canteenUnit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards/99999
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4.10 GET – 401 Unauthorized (no token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GuestCards
Accept: application/json

###

