# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 7  MINIMAL API  /api/minimal/cards
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7.1 GET all cards (minimal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/cards/
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7.2 GET by canteenUnit (minimal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/cards/1003
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7.3 GET with pagination (minimal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/minimal/cards/?pageNumber=1&pageSize=2
Authorization: {{authHeader}}
Accept: application/json

